WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
[Extended Live Arena Intro: Roaring Stadium Crowd & Shredding 16-Bit Chiptune Guitar]

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.000
Citizens of the Dream Kingdom!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.500
Are you ready for perfect order?!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:01:55.500
[Instrumental Overdrive: Blistering 16-Bit Chiptune Synth Arpeggios, Heavy Arena Guitar Riffs & Stadium Crowd Roar]

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:01.800
I was tired of the chaos, I was sick of all the noise

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:08.000
The messy little glitches of these human girls and boys

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:14.300
But a kingdom needs a ruler with an iron-coded fist

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:20.800
To systematically delete the names upon his list!

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.800
No more chaos, no more heroes, just a perfect silent code

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:31.600
I am deleting every save file down this broken pixel road!

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.800
By the power of the Grand Decree!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.000
The Dream Kingdom belongs to me!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.200
Every pixel, every byte, will surrender to the night

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:46.600
When I rewrite the entire directory!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:53.500
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:03:00.200
[Instrumental Interlude: Driving Chiptune Synth Pulse & Stadium Crowd Chants]

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.200
I have taken the apprentice, I have bent his little mind

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.200
I've severed all the messy little ties he left behind

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.200
When the ceremony finishes, the glitch will be erased

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:12.400
And a perfect, flawless order will be finally embraced!

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.400
There is nowhere left to hide inside this crumbling domain

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:23.000
I will format every memory and rule the silent rain!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.000
By the power of the Grand Decree!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.200
The Dream Kingdom belongs to me!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.400
Every pixel, every byte, will surrender to the night

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.800
When I rewrite the entire directory!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:48.500
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.500
Look at the peasants, trembling down below

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.500
They cling to the light, but the light has to go!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.800
Their messy emotions, their analog tears

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:07.000
Will be swept from the server and erased from the years!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:15.200
Fools... they think a simple medallion can stop me?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:05:12.500
[Virtuoso Chiptune Guitar Solo & Heavy Double-Kick Stadium Breakdown]

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.500
By the power of the Grand Decree!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.600
The Dream Kingdom belongs to me!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.800
Every pixel, every byte, will surrender to the night

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:27.200
When I rewrite the entire directory!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:36.000
OH, BOW TO THE GRAND DECREE!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:59.800
[Instrumental Finale: Crushing Half-Time Stadium Breakdown & Chiptune Synth Fanfare]

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:08.500
OH, BOW TO THE GRAND DECREE!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:17.160
[Outro: Final Crushing Power Chords & Roaring Stadium Standing Ovation]
